# Canonical contributor identities.
#
# One person had committed under several git names, which splits a single
# maintainer across multiple rows in `git shortlog`, GitHub's contributor
# graph, and most repo-analysis tooling. This file maps them back together
# retroactively without rewriting history.
#
# Verify with: git shortlog -sne

